# Admin panel

- Next.js 15 App Router; dev port 3002.
- API calls: use existing `adminFetch` / auth helpers; JWT in `localStorage` (`jk_token`).
- Stack dev: `npm run dev:stack:admin` from monorepo root.
- ERP build/check: `npm run build:erp`, `npm run typecheck:erp`, `npm run check:predeploy:admin`.
